|> Section
    title=What is probability theory

    In this course we'll learn about probability theory. But what exactly is probability theory? Like some other mathematical fields (but unlike some others), it has a dual role:

    \begin{itemize}
    \item It is a \textbf{rigorous mathematical theory} -- with definitions, lemmas, theorems, proofs etc.
    \item It is a \textbf{mathematical model} that purports to explain or model real-life phenomena.
    \end{itemize}
